Modifications made in this fork
-------------------------------
All changes are confined to the Manager app's presentation layer and to
tooling. The theme is OFF by default; with the switch off, upstream appearance
and behaviour are unchanged.

  * Added an optional, self-contained Compose theme layer under
    manager/app/src/main/java/me/weishu/kernelsu/ui/theme/yuancore/
    (design tokens, colour-scheme overlay, composition-local switch,
    animated concentric-core orb, and home hero card).
  * Wired a persisted setting through repository / ViewModel / both settings
    screens, and injected the palette into the Material and Miuix shells.
  * Added English default strings plus zh-rCN translations.
  * Added tools/yuancore_compose_verify.py and publication-hygiene tooling.
  * Added this NOTICE and README-YuanCore.md.

Explicitly NOT changed:
    applicationId / package name, signing configuration, launcher and splash
    assets, kernel/Kbuild variables, Natives.kt, JNI (jni.cc), ksud,
    supercall, allowlist, superuser logic, module installation, kernel/,
    apk_sign.c and throne_tracker.c. No root authorisation behaviour differs
    from upstream.

